{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_st03",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_st03",
  "title": "须问汤",
  "storyCode": "OR-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f012a508143d2f4b98f7ca228ed3150b5af9dbb8ddc5a366f3202916a7284712",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......今夕何夕？\n幽暗的陵墓不见天日，在这片混沌黑暗中，仿佛时间都已静止。\n距离这里上一次传来动静已经过去多久？\n而这一天，这里多出了一道声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你留在这里，很久了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虞先生，上车吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下还有个不情之请。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这位兄弟，行个方便。帮我去那马路对面的小饭馆，买碗白饭，讨杯茶水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要入大狱，也不好空着肚子去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "分内的事，您稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "判决已下，总不好一直赖在大理寺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道......今日专程，来送送您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是不怨我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然已经知晓事情全貌，又何怨之有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要怨，也只能怨您没有早些告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若我早些告诉你，恐怕现在你也得戴上这副镣铐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "总要为大理寺留下几个好苗子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对前辈的定罪，我也提出过异议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实，前辈若是觉得量刑不公，大可申请三法司复审——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道你觉得，我的所作所为，担不起这十年牢狱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可您做的这一切，终究是为了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "法就是法，不是“道义”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今日的虞澄若不服法，将来又会有多少个虞澄，为了他们各自的“道义”，造出多少乱事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还说这样的蠢话，不像我带出来的徒弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晚辈失言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，要如何让这个“法”，接近更多人心中的道义，那就是你们后来人的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会等着......山上的那棵松树还在，我还等着到时候，你把它砍下来给我做棺材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说起来，你今日来给我送行，为何不穿大理寺的官服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我辞官了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一道惊雷，能照亮眼前一瞬，但它断不清世上一切是非黑白与真假善恶。我看不清的事还有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "山上的那棵青松还在，但到底也只是一棵青松而已。登山人在这棵青松上看到了什么，还要看登山人自己的心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会回天师府，再修行一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不明白的事，稀里糊涂地做下去，总归做不出名堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前辈......我最后，还有一事不解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您究竟为何......执意要查太师的案子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......为什么这么问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我整理了这件案子的前后资料，才发现，为这案子付出一切的，不止顾筌一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青砚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顾筌如此尚有动机，可您除了当年奉命厘清大理寺未解决的旧案，与这件案子并无直接关联。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虞先生，给您打的饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "余味居的跑堂，说什么也不肯收钱，还说随时等着您再到店里去做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇怪，我也没说是给您打的饭呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想起几十年前，我第一次在饭馆里遇见顾筌的时候，他跟我说什么“五色令人目盲，五味令人口爽”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我后来才想明白，到底还是因为我这人目光短浅，舌头粗钝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼中只能见得清白真相，嘴里只咽得下清白滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身穿囚服的男人回过头，望向了大理寺的门匾，望向了藏在门后的决院。\n他躬下身，掬起柏树下一抔未化的残雪，撒入碗中，三两口扒完了饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......且去也。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哟，走了这么远了，还准备上哪去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......与你何干？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在大炎的地界上撒泼耍浑，还想让我当看不见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们这些老东西，我看是伤疤没好就忘了痛。我们当年能把你们揍一顿，从这片土地上赶出去，现在照样能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就凭你一人？可笑......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，想打架？行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你肚子里装下了几片小天地，我倒要看看你和那个画画的谁的本事更大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "残山剩水，经得住我几把火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会为你的挑衅付出代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，就算在这宰了你，你还是能原样再捏一个出来，没什么意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你在找一个退缩的理由，我可以接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "懒得和你掰扯，在我找到你的本体，彻底干掉你之前，我还想问你一个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是很好奇，那个臭棋篓子到底许了什么好处，让你心甘情愿听他使唤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对......应该说，“你们”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他的谋划与我无关，我们不过是有些共同目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要找的，是那个被囚禁在陵墓里的，可耻的叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是真心想报仇，早就该将祂那些个分身一一杀了，然后等着祂死在和大炎的战争里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么多年过去了，你所谓的“同族”，这片大地上也不剩几只了吧......你到底还是念旧的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看在这点“人情味”上，倒不能把你们和野兽等同视之了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......不对，这也不是你和他合谋的全部理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别以为能骗过我，这么多年来，炎国一直留着几双眼睛在盯着你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们还惦记着，百灶城下的那个东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸他......会在这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟着能打听到的消息，只能找到这里来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......和他分别这么多年来，我倒头一回希望关于他的传闻是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那个传闻中打遍武林，甚至多次故意伤人的武疯子，也实在没法想象会有第二个人了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸，为什么会变成那样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他是这世上第一等的痴人，可越是痴人，心智越不该被动摇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个声音？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "槐琥......一会见到他，千万要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许现在只有你能叫醒他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鲤叔......我们走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（难道那把剑，真的是劫数......？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（梁洵啊梁洵......要是槐天裴有个三长两短，这笔账就只能记在你的头上了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隔着尚远的一段距离，山洞深处，隐约可见一个魁梧的身影。\n沉重的拳头不住地砸在岩壁上，在上面留下了点点梅花似的血斑。每一拳落下，都震得整座洞穴摇摇晃晃。\n来人这才意识到，这个“山洞”，竟是被此人一拳一拳打出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疯癫的喃语",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四十年......天下第一......我何时......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疯癫的喃语",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剑......不可给人......丢了......还是丢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疯癫的喃语",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女儿......不许伤害我的女儿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸......醒一醒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "差不多能看到百灶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座驿馆，竟也算故地重游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎么，你们坚持要陪我一同过来，现在却一言不发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在这里死去的，皆是我们的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也皆是为了“忠义”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魏公，有人跟随。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好剑法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多年不见，你的剑法与当年已不可同日而语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......陈家小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不见......魏彦吾......舅舅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晖洁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本以为在龙门做的事，就是你能做出的最愚蠢的决定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，还有你带着的这些人......现在又打算如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不该在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道是文月......告诉了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我自己的决定，与他人无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这件事同样与你无关——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......的确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从来没有问过你过去的事，我想那是你的私事，我也无权干涉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这几年我又去过了许多地方，见过不少没见过、没想过的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也想明白了，这世上万般矛盾，总有一个“公义”可言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "母亲的事......姐姐的事......不能说与你的过往无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我想亲眼看看，这段纠缠了你一辈子的往事，究竟要怎样收场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......原来是梦啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过会梦到祂也不奇怪就是了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小大厨从躺椅上跳下来，使劲伸了个懒腰，又努力揉了揉眼睛。\n眼前的厨房还是原来的模样，锅碗瓢盆皆在原处。\n忽然间，他像是想起了什么，匆忙打开橱柜，抱出一堆装着油盐酱醋的瓶子。\n他小心翼翼地依次将每一味调料送入口中，眉头紧锁，仔细思索。\n过了许久，笑容才在他脸上浮现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还好......还好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是一样的滋味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是人是兽，记不记得，好像也没差嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "世味悠悠，这一路要找的滋味也都算找到了，再往后的事啊......不想了不想了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今朝有味今朝醉，明日愁来明日愁......也没什么大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先开张吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
